{"id":"vod_md_6088","vodId":"6088","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"青之驱魔师：京都不净王篇","name_cn":"青之驱魔师：京都不净王篇","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231019-1/11fc3878ee32d042fe78dc1164487853.jpg"},"summary":"人类居住的“物质界”和恶魔居住的“虚无界”本来是互不干涉的两个次元，但是因为恶魔出于对物质的凭依，对物质界有了干涉。于是人类之中便有了驱除恶魔的“驱魔师”存在。魔神（撒旦）的孩子奥村燐，隐藏了自己的出身，决意成为驱魔师，前往正十字学园内部存在的驱魔师培训机构·驱魔补习班学习。在地之王袭击的时候，奥村燐魔神的私生子的事败露了。因为畏惧魔神的“蓝炎”，同伴们与奥村燐之间的距离……在那样的时候，学园最深部被封印了“不净王的左眼”被不明人员偷窃，奥村燐等人陷入到了无法预料的事态。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-19 07:40:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/h7ZTbtTZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/pDdODP2w/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/PCfeoNEV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/5LnWEAAk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/O9I9aqNF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/KhS9sq7P/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/Zl50NJsK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/yYpDbBSy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/LjbCUQxz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/LMVW4V4l/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/YWcLetAL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/BguS5JEF/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:50.304Z"}